  "originalQuery": "You have been tasked to design a solution for a global e-commerce company using BigQuery. They require real-time analysis of sales transactions. The company has a strong presence in the US, Europe, and Asia. Your design should prioritize data locality and low latency querying for each region. What is the optimal approach to meet these requirements?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Use BigQuery in a multi-region setup and partition data by region.<br/>B. Implement BigQuery Omni and analyze data across multiple public clouds for each region.<br/>C. Set up a single BigQuery instance in the US and use BigQuery Transfer Service for Europe and Asia.<br/>D. Deploy a separate BigQuery dataset in each region and use BigQuery’s cross-dataset querying.",
